 <i class="lucide lucide-check-circle mr-2"></i>
 <span>à¦ªà§à¦¶ à¦¨à§‹à¦Ÿà¦¿à¦«à¦¿à¦•à§‡à¦¶à¦¨ à¦¸à¦•à§à¦·à¦®</span>
 </div>
 `;
 break;

 case 'denied':
 html = `
 <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 flex items-center mb-0">
 <i class="lucide lucide-alert-triangle mr-2"></i>
 <div>
 <span>à¦ªà§à¦¶ à¦¨à§‹à¦Ÿà¦¿à¦«à¦¿à¦•à§‡à¦¶à¦¨ à¦…à¦•à§à¦·à¦®</span><br>
 <small class="text-neutral-500">à¦¬à§à¦°à¦¾à¦‰à¦œà¦¾à¦° à¦¸à§‡à¦Ÿà¦¿à¦‚à¦¸ à¦ªà¦°à¦¿à¦¬à¦°à§à¦¤à¦¨ à¦•à¦°à§à¦¨ à¦…à¦¥à¦¬à¦¾ à¦¨à§‹à¦Ÿà¦¿à¦«à¦¿à¦•à§‡à¦¶à¦¨ à¦ªà§à¦¨à¦°à¦¾à¦¯à¦¼ à¦¸à¦•à§à¦·à¦® à¦•à¦°à§à¦¨</small>
 </div>
 </div>
 `;
 break;

 case 'default':
 html = `
 <div>
 <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500">à¦ªà§à¦¶ à¦¨à§‹à¦Ÿà¦¿à¦«à¦¿à¦•à§‡à¦¶à¦¨ à¦à¦–à¦¨à¦“ à¦¸à¦•à§à¦·à¦® à¦¨à¦¯à¦¼à¥¤ à¦¸à¦¬ à¦†à¦ªà¦¡à§‡à¦Ÿ à¦ªà§‡à¦¤à§‡ à¦¸à¦•à§à¦·à¦® à¦•à¦°à§à¦¨à¥¤</p>
 <button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-indigo-600/90 transition-colors w-full" onclick="requestPermission()">
 <i class="lucide lucide-bell mr-1"></i>à¦¸à¦•à§à¦·à¦® à¦•à¦°à§à¦¨
 </button>
 </div>
 `;
 break;

 default:
 html = `
 <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200 flex items-center mb-0">
 <i class="lucide lucide-info mr-2"></i>
